<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The Controller may determine the amount of the deposit which any person, selling any price-controlled goods subject to the condition that the container of those goods is to be returned, may require in respect of the container, and may prescribe the amount which that person shall, on the return of the container, refund to the person by whom the container is returned and the conditions subject to which the refund shall become payable. Prices determined to include tax"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_II__cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
