<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_II__cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Where prices of any goods or charges for any services are determined under this Part, such prices or charges shall include all government taxes, duties and any other charges. Seller to display list of prices"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
