<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may appoint, from among public officers, a Price Controller, such number of Deputy Price Controllers and such number of Assistant Price Controllers and other officers as may be necessary for the purposes of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
