<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Price Controller shall, subject to the general direction and control of the Minister, perform the duties imposed and exercise the powers conferred upon him under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
