<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "57" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person guilty of an offence under this Act for which no penalty is expressly provided shall, on conviction, be liable—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
