<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "if such person is a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit, and for a second or subsequent offence, to a fine not exceeding two hundred and fifty thousand ringgit;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
