<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3__cl_28__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Assistant Controller shall have access at all times, to any places or premises where any business is carried out for the purpose of collecting or monitoring the prices of goods or charges for services."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
