<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3__cl_28__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Assistant Controller in accessing the places or premises under subsection (1) may bring with him any authorized officer as he thinks necessary for the due administration of this Act. Power to enter into premises with search warrant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
