<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3__cl_29__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who, without lawful authority, breaks, tampers with or damages the seal referred to in subsection (5) or removes any book, record, accounts, document, computerized data, goods or thing under seal or attempts to do so commits an offence under this Act. Power of entry and search and seizure without a warrant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3__cl_30> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
