<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3__cl_34__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3__cl_34__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the premises are unoccupied, the Assistant Controller who effected the seizure shall wherever possible post a list of the things seized conspicuously on the premises. Forfeiture of goods"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
