<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3__cl_37> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any goods seized in exercise of the power conferred by this Act are of perishable nature or where the custody of such goods involves unreasonable expense and inconvenience, such goods may be sold by the Assistant Controller at any time and the proceeds of the sale held to abide by the result of any prosecution or claim under this section. No cost or damages arising from seizure to be recoverable"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3__cl_38> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@/~part_VI__chp_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/29/eng@> .
